  {
   "id": 667667,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>The graph shows the yearly balance, in dollars, in two investment accounts. Account A starts with $2,000. Account B starts with $1,000.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"A line graph displays two financial trends over 14 years. One starts higher but grows slower (red), while the other begins lower but accelerates to surpass it (teal).\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"280\" src=\"exercises/media/c36e6a42d963b31b.jpg\" width=\"295\"></p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1331883,
     "content_html": "Both accounts grow by the same amount each year."
    },
    {
     "id": 1331884,
     "content_html": "Both accounts grow more quickly as time goes on."
    },
    {
     "id": 1331885,
     "content_html": "Account A grows by the same amount each year. Account B grows more quickly as time goes on"
    },
    {
     "id": 1331886,
     "content_html": "Account A grows more quickly as time goes on. Account B grows by the same amount each year."
    }
